w: On the night that I_ was mar-ried and on my mar-riage
"Dm" D6 A,C | D3E DC A,2 | "C" G4 "Dm" A2 AG | "C" E3D C2 E2 |
w: bed, There_ came a bold_ sea cap-tain and he stood at my bed
