w: In Dub-lin's fair ci-ty_ Where girls are so pre-tty,_ I
"G" B2 A2 G2 | d2 c2 B2 | B3 A G2 | "D" A4 DD |
w: first set my eyes on sweet Mol-ly Mal-one, As she
"G" G2 G3 G | GB-B2 G2 | "Am" A2 A3 A | Ac-c2 AA |
w: wheeled her wheel-bar-row_ Through streets broad and nar-row,_  Cry-ing
"G" Bd-d2 c2 | Bd-d2 c2 | "D" B3 G A2 | "G" G4 "Chorus:" D2 ||
w: "Cock-les_ and mus-sels!_ A-live, a-live Oh!" "A-
