w: Oh_ see the_ host of_ fleet-foot men who march with fac-es wan, from_
"C"g2 g2 g2 eg | "F"a2 a2 "C"g2 ed | "Am"c2A2 "Dm"f2 e2 | "G"d6 ef |
w: farm-stead and from_ fish-er's cot a_\-long the banks of Bann, they_
"C"g2 g2 g2 eg | "F"a2 a2 "C"g2 ed | "Am"c2A2 "Dm"f2 e2 | "G"d6 cd |
w: come with ven-geance_ in their eyes, too_ late, too late are they, for young
